# GPS Map Camera — Environment Configuration
# ============================================
#
# Copy this file to set up your local development environment.
#
# ANDROID GOOGLE MAPS API KEY
# ---------------------------
# Add your Google Maps API key to: android/local.properties
#
#   GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSy...your_key_here
#
# The key is read by build.gradle.kts and injected into AndroidManifest.xml
# via manifestPlaceholders. It is NEVER committed to git.
#
# Key restrictions (Google Cloud Console):
#   - Application restriction: Android apps
#   - Package name: com.gpsmapcamera.app
#   - SHA-1: your debug/release certificate fingerprint
#   - API restrictions: Maps SDK for Android, Geocoding API
#
# GOOGLE GEOCODING API KEY (for Dart HTTP requests)
# --------------------------------------------------
# For reverse geocoding in Dart, store the key in a local config file
# that is gitignored. Details will be provided in Phase 4.
#
# NEVER hard-code API keys in Dart source files.
# NEVER commit real API keys to GitHub.
